12. Mental model

The safest way to think about it:

create_requests_from_reservations
= creates/updates the work

enqueue_* scripts
= decide who should be notified and create pending messages

send_pending_outbound_messages
= actually sends pending messages through Twilio

And the two main safety switches are:

CLEANING_SMS_PROPERTY_IDS
= which property messages are allowed through

SMS_SEND_ENABLED
= whether Twilio is actually called

Today’s issue came from the wrapper overriding both of those with hardcoded values.